  "doctrine": [],
  "note": "The evidence identifies the spice widely but leaves the routes by which its name spread open. The Arabic and Aramaic words for hiding explain the proposed connection with treasure kept in store. Daniel specifies the precious metals without saying where or how they were concealed. SEDRA 1539 and 1540 have New Testament occurrences; verb 1541 has none."
